Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: export the DRAM type from boot0 as ${dram_type}

The A133 boards share one image and differ in boot0, which trains their
DRAM; its type is what the boot command can tell them apart by.
---
--- a/board/sunxi/board_common.c	2026-10-06 19:30:21.324303756 +0000
+++ b/board/sunxi/board_common.c	2026-10-06 19:30:21.336303755 +0000
@@ -641,6 +641,11 @@
 			sunxi_board_shutdown();
 		}
 #endif
+		/*
+		 * boot0's DRAM type tells the A133 board families apart
+		 * (3 DDR3, 4 DDR4, 7 LPDDR3, 8 LPDDR4): bootcmd picks the DT
+		 */
+		env_set_ulong("dram_type", uboot_spare_head.boot_data.dram_para[1] & 0xff);
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_BOOT_GUI
 		void board_bootlogo_display(void);
